Discussion Questions
Parameter added:
NETWORK_SCAN_PORT_THRESHOLD

Configured value:
4

Event that triggered a finding:
Network scan detected from 172.18.0.20 against ports 22,80,443,3306

This event triggered T1046 - Network Service Discovery because it
contained 4 scanned ports, which is equal to the configured threshold.

Event that did not trigger a finding:
Network scan detected from 172.18.0.20 against ports 22,80

This event did not trigger T1046 because it contained only 2 scanned
ports, which is below the configured threshold of 4.

Effect on false positives and false negatives:
A lower threshold makes the detector more sensitive and may increase
false positives.

A higher threshold reduces false positives, but it may increase false
negatives by missing low-volume reconnaissance activity.
